{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24438","headline":"梦得相过援琴命酒因弹秋思偶咏所怀兼寄继之待价二相府 · 白居易","name":"梦得相过援琴命酒因弹秋思偶咏所怀兼寄继之待价二相府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲居静侣偶相招，小饮初酣琴欲调。\n我正风前弄秋思，君应天上听云韶。\n时和始见陶钧力，物遂方知盛圣朝。\n双凤栖梧鱼在藻，飞沈随分各逍遥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24438.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24438","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}